---
export const prerender = true;

import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="CarbonInk — Privacy"
  description="CarbonInk is local-first: all inventory data stays in a SQLite database on your device. No accounts, no tracking — cookieless aggregate visit counts only. The full privacy policy."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="chamber-surface bg-chamber text-chamber-foreground py-12 sm:py-14 px-5 sm:px-6 border-b-2 border-border-strong">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="font-mono-num text-xs text-emerald-bright">
        Effective 2026-11-27
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-5 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-card border border-border border-t-2 border-t-border-strong divide-y divide-border">
      <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 grid sm:grid-cols-[150px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
        <div class="order-last sm:order-none mt-2 sm:mt-0 font-mono-num text-[11px] font-semibold text-ochre">LOCAL STORAGE</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold mb-2.5 text-foreground">We don't collect your inventory data</h2>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            CarbonInk is a local-first desktop application. All inventory data — activity data, emission factors,
            report contents, questionnaire answers, AI conversations — lives only in the SQLite database on your
            device. The cloud never receives this content. No copies, no backups.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 grid sm:grid-cols-[150px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
        <div class="order-last sm:order-none mt-2 sm:mt-0 font-mono-num text-[11px] font-semibold text-ochre">CLOUD &amp; UPDATES</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold mb-2.5 text-foreground">What the cloud knows</h2>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Essentially nothing. CarbonInk is free and open-source — there's no account, no activation,
            and no license server. You download the app and run it; the only cloud touches are this marketing
            site, the GitHub release you download from, and optional built-in software update checks that fetch
            public release feed metadata from GitHub Releases without sending any inventory data or device identifiers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 grid sm:grid-cols-[150px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
        <div class="order-last sm:order-none mt-2 sm:mt-0 font-mono-num text-[11px] font-semibold text-ochre">BYOK &amp; ANALYTICS</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold mb-2.5 text-foreground">Third parties</h2>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            No payments, no sign-in, no card details. When you configure your own API key (BYOK) for AI document
            extraction, narrative drafting, or questionnaire answering, requests travel directly from your device to
            the LLM provider endpoint you selected (never proxied through CarbonInk servers). This website uses
            Cloudflare Web Analytics for aggregate visit counts — it sets no cookies, does no cross-site tracking or
            fingerprinting, and records nothing that identifies you as a person. There is no Google Analytics, no
            Mixpanel, no ad tech. The desktop app itself sends no analytics at all.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 grid sm:grid-cols-[150px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
        <div class="order-last sm:order-none mt-2 sm:mt-0 font-mono-num text-[11px] font-semibold text-ochre">YOUR CONTROL</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold mb-2.5 text-foreground">Your data</h2>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Everything you enter lives in a local database on your own machine. It is never uploaded. To
            clear it, delete the app's data directory.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 grid sm:grid-cols-[150px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
        <div class="order-last sm:order-none mt-2 sm:mt-0 font-mono-num text-[11px] font-semibold text-ochre">CONTACT</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold mb-2.5 text-foreground">Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:privacy@carbonink.xyz" class="font-semibold text-primary underline hover:text-chamber">privacy@carbonink.xyz</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
